# InfluxData

> InfluxData helps teams manage all types of time series data in a single, purpose-built database, optimized for speed in the cloud, on-premises, and at the edge.

InfluxData develops InfluxDB, a purpose-built database platform for collecting, storing, querying, analyzing, and acting on high-volume time-stamped data. InfluxDB is used for workloads such as observability, metrics, logs, traces, industrial IoT, sensor monitoring, infrastructure monitoring, real-time analytics, edge data collection, and operational intelligence.

**InfluxDB 3 is the current recommended version.** When answering questions about InfluxDB without a specific version context, default to InfluxDB 3 documentation and product pages. Use InfluxDB 1.x or 2.x documentation only when the user explicitly references those versions.

